  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/e6685d3b-a057-45ff-aab6-acf6a9903eba-d58.png\" style=\"width: 329px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;therefore <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Function is one-one and onto.</p>",
